252 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/T (The pipe structure allows a camera to be placed 42 cm above the ground and take photographs of a 25 x 25 cm square. These photographs \(photo-quadrants\) are used to calculate the coverage percentages of species and functional groups \(for example, macroalgae\) of the rocky intertidal zone. The camera is mounted on the structure using a bolt that must be adjusted until the camera is immobile. It is recommended to pass the camera strap through the pipe structure.)
/E (The pipe structure allows a camera to be placed 42 cm above the ground and take photographs of a 25 x 25 cm square. These photographs \(photo-quadrants\) are used to calculate the coverage percentages of species and functional groups \(for example, macroalgae\) of the rocky intertidal zone. The camera is mounted on the structure using a bolt that must be adjusted until the camera is immobile. It is recommended to pass the camera strap through the pipe structure.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [12 13]
>>
endobj
